  "content": "# 第22题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\nIf selected as an IOC Young Leader, one will need to ________.\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. complete a reflection task each week\n\nB. B. watch sports on the IOC channel\n\nC. C. work on a sport-based project\n\nD. D. coach and advise their peers\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nC\n\n",
  "answer": "C",
  "analysis": "本题考查定语从句。先行词是‘the factory’，关系词在从句中作visited的宾语，且指物，故用which或that。选项C正确。"
